                            	  3015: _L_z01__CalcDiagonalSpeedIndex_Swap:
                            	  3016:     ; TODO: call it speed index or angle?
                            	  3017:     ; If the difference in distances is within 8 pixels,
                            	  3018:     ; return the speed index (angle) we have.
