                            	  3621: 
                            	  3622: ; Maps an item slot to a value used in calculating the
                            	  3623: ; sprite palette row attribute.
                            	  3624: ;
                            	  3625: ; For most items, the value is the sprite palette row attribute
                            	  3626: ; itself.
