02:0003C8F2 6706            	  7583:     beq  _L_z04_UpdatePolsVoice_State0
02:0003C8F4 61000130        	  7584:     jsr     UpdatePolsVoiceState1_Jumping
02:0003C8F8 6034            	  7585:     jmp     _L_z04_UpdatePolsVoice_CheckWalkability
                            	  7586: 
