                            	  2101:     ; A. The item flashes. Attribute value 1 or 2 was chosen
                            	  2102:     ;    explicitly.
                            	  2103:     ; B. The item color varies. ItemSlotToPaletteOffsetsOrValues
                            	  2104:     ;    held an offset that was added to base palette attribute
                            	  2105:     ;    passed in [$04]. This corresponds to class 2 items.
                            	  2106:     ; C. Item doesn't change color. ItemSlotToPaletteOffsetsOrValues
                            	  2107:     ;    held absolute attributes.
                            	  2108:     ;
                            	  2109:     ; At this point, A holds the final sprite attributes.
